              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuothuru e yore duto ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu osechikou mondo ubed mangima kendo ubed gi mwandu mondo omi ngimau omedre e piny ma ubiro kawo.",
          "type": "text",
